  "excerpt": "QEI invites optometrists to an evening of eye-opening education, packed with therapeutic tips and interactive workshops.",
  "body_html": "<h3>Practising optometrists are invited to a free, interactive therapeutic workshop run by the Queensland Eye Institute clinical faculty.</h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Optometry Australia CPD logo\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-6016 size-medium\" data-warning=\"Suspicious alt text\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"300\" id=\"longdesc-return-6016\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6016&amp;referrer=5995\" sizes=\"(max-width: 175px) 100vw, 175px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2Ti-175x300.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2Ti-175x300.jpg 175w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/2Ti.jpg 375w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"175\"/></div>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Tuesday, 7th October 2025</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">5:45 pm – 8:30 pm</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Queensland Eye Institute<br/>\nLevel 1<br/>\n87 Ipswich Rd<br/>\nWoolloongabba</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/sDAfFBt57W3zGBDR7\">View map</a></p>\n<p>Numbers are strictly limited and registration is essential to secure your place.</p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=PRfiyGxDfU632q5isHsc32106l-TrbZFkpJuk2x0NG9UNlJXVlpQU0pITU5RTDZKSE44VlROTkVWTS4u&amp;route=shorturl\">Learn more and reserve your place</a></h3>",
  "details_html": "<h2 class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Presentations</h2>\n<h5><span lang=\"EN-US\">Emerging therapeutic options for Dry and Wet AMD –   </span><a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-abhishek-sharma/index.html\">A/Prof Abhishek Sharma</a></h5>\n<h5>Diseases of the Lids and Orbits –   <a href=\"../../research/researchers/dr-alexandra-manta/index.html\">Dr Alex Manta</a></h5>\n<h5>Corneal Foreign Body – Assessment, Removal and Management –  <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-david-gunn/index.html\">Dr David Gunn</a></h5>\n<h5>HSV Keratitis for Optometrists  –  <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-lee-holland/index.html\">Dr Lee Holland</a></h5>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2 class=\"x_MsoNormal\">Workshops</h2>\n<h5>Intravitreal injections – Introduction to <span class=\"x_spelle\">Syfovre – Associate Professors <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-abhishek-sharma/index.html\">Abhishek Sharma</a> and <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/associate-professor-anthony-kwan/index.html\">Anthony Kwan</a></span></h5>\n<h5>Corneal Foreign Body Removal – Drs <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-brendan-cronin/index.html\">Brendan Conin</a>, <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-david-gunn/index.html\">David Gunn</a> and <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-lee-holland/index.html\">Lee Holland</a></h5>\n<h5>Lids and Orbits Assessment – <a href=\"../../research/researchers/dr-alexandra-manta/index.html\">Dr Alexandra Manta</a></h5>\n<h5>Hydrus Insertion for Glaucoma – Drs <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-geoffrey-ryan/index.html\">Geoffrey Ryan</a> and <a href=\"../../ophthalmologists/dr-jonathan-lai/index.html\">Jonathan Lai</a></h5>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><a data-original-href=\"https://forms.office.com/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=PRfiyGxDfU632q5isHsc32106l-TrbZFkpJuk2x0NG9UNlJXVlpQU0pITU5RTDZKSE44VlROTkVWTS4u&amp;route=shorturl\" data-qei-disabled-transaction=\"true\" href=\"#\">Register here</a></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"Sponsor logos\" class=\"wp-image-6002 size-full alignleft\" data-warning=\"Missing alt text\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"180\" sizes=\"(max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Thanks-to-our-sponsors.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Thanks-to-our-sponsors.png 740w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Thanks-to-our-sponsors-300x73.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Thanks-to-our-sponsors-400x97.png 400w\" width=\"740\"/></p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"></div>\n</div>\n<div></div>",
